```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Application Layer"
        API[FastAPI Application]
        LangGraph[LangGraph Agent]
    end

    subgraph "Observability Stack"
        LangfuseUI[Langfuse UI]
        LangfuseWorker[Langfuse Worker]
        Prometheus[Prometheus]
        Grafana[Grafana]
    end

    subgraph "Data Storage Layer"
        Postgres[(PostgreSQL)]
        ClickHouse[(ClickHouse)]
        Redis[(Redis)]
        MinIO[(MinIO)]
    end

    %% Application Layer Connections
    API --> LangGraph
    API --> Postgres
    API --> Redis
    API --> LangfuseUI

    %% Observability Connections
    LangfuseUI --> Postgres
    LangfuseUI --> ClickHouse
    LangfuseUI --> MinIO
    LangfuseWorker --> Postgres
    LangfuseWorker --> ClickHouse
    LangfuseWorker --> MinIO
    API --> Prometheus
    Prometheus --> Grafana

    %% Data Flow
    LangGraph --> LangfuseUI
    Redis --> API
    MinIO --> LangfuseUI

    %% Styling
    classDef primary fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1976D2,color:white
    classDef secondary fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#388E3C,color:white
    classDef storage fill:#FF9800,stroke:#F57C00,color:white
    classDef monitoring fill:#9C27B0,stroke:#7B1FA2,color:white

    class API,LangGraph primary
    class LangfuseUI,LangfuseWorker secondary
    class Postgres,ClickHouse,Redis,MinIO storage
    class Prometheus,Grafana monitoring
``` 